      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.899999618530273
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      75.02,
      490.03,
      511.87,
      505.9
    ],
    "text": "observed that on 15.2.2001 the 4th defendant had withdrawn the identical objection. The",
