      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.209855079650879,
      11.899999618530273,
      12.206210136413574
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      76.46,
      614.82,
      295.27,
      630.69
    ],
    "text": "inquired into and a settlement was arrived at.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.899999618530273
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      76.7,
      656.34,
      513.68,
      672.21
    ],
    "text": "The learned counsel for the plaintiff submits that the dismissal was set aside on an",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.899999618530273
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      77.17,
      677.22,
      513.83,
      693.1
    ],
    "text": "application made by the plaintiff under section 87 (3) of the CPC. The learned counsel",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.756231307983398,
      11.899999618530273,
      12.206210136413574
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      77.59,
      697.15,
      513.54,
      713.03
    ],
    "text": "submits that the Partition Law provides for dismissal of the action for non-prosecution.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.899999618530273,
      12.206210136413574
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      506.33,
      745.11,
      515.1,
      760.72
    ],
    "text": "2",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.699999809265137
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      76.51,
      71.73,
      512.9,
      92.61
    ],
    "text": "However it does not make provision similar to section 87 of the epe where a dismissal is",
