      337.59,
      518.86,
      448.94
    ],
    "text": "87 (l): Where the plaintiff .... make default in appearing on the day fixed for the trial, the court shall dismiss the plaintiffs action. (2) not reproduced. (3) The plaintiff may apply within a reasonable time from the date of dismissal, by way of petition supported by affidavit, to have the dismissal set aside, and if on the hearing of such application ... the court is satisfied that there was reasonable grounds for the non-appearance of the plaintiff, the court shall make order setting aside the dismissal..",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.600000381469727,
      11.611743927001953,
      11.627467155456543,
      11.65148639678955,
